    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d758">

                <pb facs="0814" n="800" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg800"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.20210/2867</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by Mr. J. Darnel Hanley, Division of Foreign
                        Activity Correlation</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-05-15">May 15, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The FBI just informed me that word has been received that the Court and Judge
                    have decided that because the PQZ Case involves certain military personnel the
                    Court is consequently without jurisdiction.</p>
                <p>The PQZ Case is reported to have been reassigned to a Military Court.</p>
                <p>There is no information available to indicate whether or not this is a desirable
                    move.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
